Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.35,0:20:43.85,Sign,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an7\pos(1300,60)\fs50\c&H8B95C5&\bord0\shad0}給蓮司\N\N之前突然瞪了你\N還推了你\N對不起\N那是我試著照葵衣教我的\N「推不動的話就拉拉看」 去做的\N但好像不太順利\N\N可是…\N蓮司不理我 還有跟其他女生說話\N讓我覺得很難過\N這也是真的\N\N我… 該怎麼辦才好？
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,Main,0,0,0,,---- Main ----
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.01,0:00:05.68,Text,Part-timer A,0,0,0,,欸 蓮司君 能幫我補充一下獎品嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.68,0:00:06.98,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,啊 好的！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.68,0:00:15.56,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,好了…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.01,0:00:17.97,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,哈嘍 蓮司！
Dialogue: 1,0:00:16.01,0:00:17.97,Text-English,Lily,0,0,0,,Hello, Renji!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.74,0:00:24.50,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,莉莉 今天也來了啊
Dialogue: 1,0:00:24.50,0:00:25.84,Text-English,Lily,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.38,0:00:30.34,High,Lily,0,0,0,,我今天也把我們的交流筆記帶來了 你看一下吧
Dialogue: 1,0:00:27.38,0:00:30.34,High-English,Lily,0,0,0,,I brought our notebook today too. Give it a read.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.35,0:00:33.14,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,好喔好喔
Dialogue: 1,0:00:31.35,0:00:33.14,Text-English,Renji,0,0,0,,Okay, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.60,0:00:35.44,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,謝謝妳 莉莉
Dialogue: 1,0:00:33.60,0:00:35.44,Text-English,Renji,0,0,0,,Thank you, Lily-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.88,0:00:39.49,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,她的名字是莉莉·貝卡
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.27,0:00:43.73,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,我們從前陣子開始兩個人一起寫交換日記
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.27,0:00:43.73,Comment,Renji,0,0,0,,※ 蓮司在此處使用了更通俗的「交換日記」來稱呼「交流筆記」
Comment: 0,0:00:40.27,0:00:43.73,Comment,Comment,0,0,0,,（上面是 Gemini 的解釋，不過我合理懷疑這裡其實是製作方用錯詞彙了，參見下方另一個錯誤--椎名真晝不只可愛而已）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.77,0:00:45.77,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,根據那本「遊樂場筆記」…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.31,0:00:50.78,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,她好像是幾個月前才剛從英國搬來日本的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.36,0:00:55.12,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,聽說她本來就很喜歡日本的遊戲和動畫
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.12,0:00:58.24,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,無奈日文會話對她來說很困難
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.24,0:01:00.70,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,所以一直交不太到朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.70,0:01:03.48,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,才會一個人跑來遊樂場
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.50,0:01:07.29,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,看來她也吃了不少苦頭呢…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.29,0:01:10.90,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,但希望她至少能在這裡玩得開心一點…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.28,0:01:15.21,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,怎… 怎麼了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.34,0:01:19.51,High,Lily,0,0,0,,你沒有發現什麼嗎？
Dialogue: 1,0:01:17.34,0:01:19.51,High-English,Lily,0,0,0,,Noticed anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.47,0:01:22.27,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,呃…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.27,0:01:22.97,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.27,0:01:25.40,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,該不會是肩膀痠痛之類的吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.20,0:01:29.69,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,咦！？ 生氣了？ 為什麼！？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.11,0:01:32.00,Text,Part-timer A,0,0,0,,啊 莉莉 妳來啦
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.08,0:01:35.23,Text,Part-timer A,0,0,0,,今天的衣服很好看呢
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.48,0:01:37.00,Text,Part-timer B,0,0,0,,妳也剪頭髮啦？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.00,0:01:38.04,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 1,0:01:37.00,0:01:38.04,Text-English,Lily,0,0,0,,Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.04,0:01:38.75,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.06,0:01:40.72,Text,Part-timer B,0,0,0,,慢慢逛喔
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.12,0:01:42.71,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,謝謝
Dialogue: 1,0:01:41.12,0:01:42.71,Text-English,Lily,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.74,0:01:44.25,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,呃…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.49,0:01:48.23,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,異… 異文化交流還真困難…
Dialogue: 1,0:03:31.82,0:03:33.34,Text-English,Lily,0,0,0,,Cheers, Dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.48,0:03:44.23,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,早… 早安
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.23,0:03:45.97,Text,Student 1,0,0,0,,啊… 早安
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.97,0:03:47.61,Text,Student 2,0,0,0,,早安… 貝卡同學
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.39,0:03:58.29,Text,Hotaru,0,0,0,,大家對莉莉同學還是很客氣…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.29,0:04:02.25,Text,Hotaru,0,0,0,,這時候身為班長的我得想點辦法才行！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.49,0:04:07.04,Text,Hotaru,0,0,0,,那個… 英文打招呼的正確發音是…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.04,0:04:08.17,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,哈囉
Dialogue: 1,0:04:07.04,0:04:08.17,Text-English,Aoi,0,0,0,,Hello!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.17,0:04:08.81,Text,Hotaru,0,0,0,,對！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.81,0:04:09.69,Text,Hotaru,0,0,0,,Hello…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.67,0:04:10.26,Text,Hotaru,0,0,0,,…咦？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.56,0:04:14.49,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,我的名字是草壁葵衣
Dialogue: 1,0:04:11.56,0:04:14.49,Text-English,Aoi,0,0,0,,My name is Aoi Kusakabe!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.49,0:04:18.24,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,難得我們同班！ 好好相處吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.25,0:04:20.70,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,那個…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.70,0:04:23.87,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,I'm your friend… 嗯 我想當！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.87,0:04:24.90,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.24,0:04:26.55,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,我的朋友？
Dialogue: 1,0:04:25.24,0:04:26.55,Text-English,Lily,0,0,0,,My friend?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.55,0:04:28.25,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,哦 對 對
Dialogue: 1,0:04:26.55,0:04:28.25,Text-English,Aoi,0,0,0,,Oh! Yes, yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.25,0:04:31.95,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,啊 莉莉妳喜歡男子漢無尾熊啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.95,0:04:33.42,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,很可愛對吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.42,0:04:35.68,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,This is very cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.80,0:04:37.80,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,不！
Dialogue: 1,0:04:36.80,0:04:37.80,Text-English,Lily,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.80,0:04:39.57,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,牠很帥氣
Dialogue: 1,0:04:37.80,0:04:39.57,Text-English,Lily,0,0,0,,He's very cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.80,0:04:44.39,Top,Lily,0,0,0,,不是可愛 是很帥氣！ 非常帥！
Dialogue: 1,0:04:40.80,0:04:44.39,Top-English,Lily,0,0,0,,It's not "cute." He's cool, like seriously cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.79,0:04:47.06,Text,Hotaru,0,0,0,,Co? Cou...? Cooa?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.39,0:04:46.38,Top,Lily,0,0,0,,牠有很多種模式喔
Dialogue: 1,0:04:44.39,0:04:46.38,Top-English,Lily,0,0,0,,He's got all sorts of modes, you know!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.89,0:04:49.57,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,哥哥 拜託你！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.57,0:04:53.30,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,一天之內把我變成遊樂場高手！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.41,0:04:57.56,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,什麼是遊樂場高手啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.56,0:05:00.83,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,話說 妳不是對遊戲完全沒興趣嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.18,0:05:03.49,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,社團也一直都是運動社團
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.49,0:05:05.96,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,話是這麼說沒錯啦…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.96,0:05:10.45,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,因為明天要跟班上的同學去遊樂場… 那個…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.88,0:05:13.20,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,想讓她看看我帥氣的一面
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.20,0:05:15.95,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,哦 跟朋友去遊樂場啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.95,0:05:19.18,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,她是從國外轉學過來的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.07,0:05:24.85,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,一開始溝通不良 所以很難跟她變熟…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.85,0:05:28.00,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,不過最近我們開始比較能溝通了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.00,0:05:30.26,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,總算變成朋友了！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.67,0:05:33.77,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,這種事我最近好像才剛聽過…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.77,0:05:37.14,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,不不不 這應該也算常有的事 吧…？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.48,0:05:39.33,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,是… 是喔…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.33,0:05:42.91,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,你聽我說喔！ 那個女生在遊樂場夾不到獎品的時候
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.91,0:05:45.63,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,聽說有個店員跑去幫她耶！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.63,0:05:46.77,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,是喔…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.77,0:05:51.70,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,我想說如果我也能辦到的話 應該能跟她變得更要好吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.84,0:05:53.09,Top,Imaginary Aoi,0,0,0,,給妳的禮物
Dialogue: 1,0:05:50.84,0:05:53.09,Top-English,Imaginary Aoi,0,0,0,,Present, For you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.08,0:05:53.88,Top,Imaginary Lily,0,0,0,,哇…！
Dialogue: 1,0:05:53.08,0:05:53.88,Top-English,Imaginary Lily,0,0,0,,Oh...!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.89,0:05:54.66,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,是… 是喔
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.66,0:05:59.17,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,而且聽說那個店員還對她「愛的告白」了！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.91,0:06:01.68,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,哇！ 幹嘛！？ 你怎麼了！？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.20,0:06:03.91,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,沒… 沒事
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.91,0:06:05.68,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,啊… 難道！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.68,0:06:08.26,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,那個店員該不會就是哥哥你吧！？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.52,0:06:11.54,Text,Renji's Mom,0,0,0,,真是的 你們在幹嘛！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.54,0:06:13.93,Text,Renji & Aoi,0,0,0,,對… 對不起！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.20,0:06:17.56,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,不過 你剛剛那個反應 難道… 真的就是哥哥！？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.56,0:06:19.77,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,不是啦 等等 等等
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.77,0:06:22.17,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,也是啦 怎麼可能
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.17,0:06:22.69,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,咦？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.69,0:06:27.11,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,如果哥哥是那種會突然跟國中生告白的超級大變態
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.11,0:06:31.00,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,我就要去跟爸爸商量 請他跟你斷絕父子關係喔！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.00,0:06:34.28,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,哈… 哈哈… 說的也是！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.28,0:06:36.44,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,這下事情大條了！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.14,0:06:43.08,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,啊！ 真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.08,0:06:46.75,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,一個都夾不到！ 這爪子太沒力了吧！？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.75,0:06:50.58,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,都是哥哥不肯教我玩遊戲的訣竅啦！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.58,0:06:52.40,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,回家看我怎麼教訓他！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.13,0:06:55.38,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,咦！？ 莉莉！？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.83,0:06:59.57,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,難道莉莉要為了我…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.66,0:07:28.38,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,哎呀
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.09,0:07:33.43,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,哇！ 莉莉！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.89,0:07:36.06,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,不… 不要哭啦
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.54,0:07:38.31,Text,Sunglass Renji,0,0,0,,請問您怎麼了嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.82,0:07:41.49,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,這個登場時機也太剛好了吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.49,0:07:44.05,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,不會錯的！ 這傢伙一定是…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.82,0:07:48.07,Text,Sunglass Renji,0,0,0,,歡迎光臨 兩位小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.32,0:07:54.58,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,雖然試著變裝了… 但能騙得過去嗎！？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.51,0:07:59.59,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,這個人… 是小混混！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.59,0:08:01.20,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,看來成功騙過去了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.95,0:08:05.55,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,欸！？ 這種人居然對國中生愛的告白
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.55,0:08:07.87,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,這根本是犯罪了吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.87,0:08:09.97,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,莉莉 妳沒問題嗎！？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.77,0:08:13.88,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,「男子漢」模式！
Dialogue: 1,0:08:11.77,0:08:13.88,Text-English,Lily,0,0,0,,"Otokogi" mode!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.88,0:08:15.61,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,那是什麼啦！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.61,0:08:19.52,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,是說莉莉完全是一副戀愛少女的表情！？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.52,0:08:22.47,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,不行啦 莉莉 不能喜歡上這種男人！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.95,0:08:28.12,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,會被他啃得連骨頭都不剩 然後被丟在深夜的街頭喔！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.94,0:08:32.00,Text,Sunglass Renji,0,0,0,,夾那種娃娃有個訣竅喔
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.26,0:08:33.23,Text,Aoi; Lily,0,0,0,,咦？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.47,0:08:38.88,Text,Sunglass Renji,0,0,0,,重心在頭部 所以不要夾身體 夾頭會比較好
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.88,0:08:44.47,Text,Sunglass Renji,0,0,0,,立起來之後 會因為頭比較重而倒下 可能就會順勢掉出來了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.47,0:08:45.36,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,哦
Dialogue: 1,0:08:44.47,0:08:45.36,Text-English,Lily,0,0,0,,Oh...!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.36,0:08:46.62,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,是這樣嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.11,0:08:48.99,Text,Sunglass Renji,0,0,0,,妳可以試試看
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.99,0:08:50.62,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,好… 好的…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.94,0:08:54.73,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,他都這樣說了 我也不好拒絕
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.73,0:08:58.72,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,是說 照著他的建議就能簡單夾到的話 我們還辛苦什…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.47,0:09:04.40,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,騙人！？ 真的只用一次就夾到了！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.40,0:09:06.38,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,太厲害了！
Dialogue: 1,0:09:04.40,0:09:06.38,Text-English,Lily,0,0,0,,That's amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.08,0:09:10.57,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,他明明很認真給我們建議
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.57,0:09:13.95,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,我卻因為外表就隨便認定他是怪人…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.95,0:09:15.78,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,我得跟他好好道歉才行…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.02,0:09:18.58,Text,Sunglass Renji,0,0,0,,做得不錯嘛！ 真了不起！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.17,0:09:19.95,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,咦
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.77,0:09:23.40,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,等… 你幹嘛隨便碰我啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.40,0:09:26.03,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,糟糕！ 我忘了我還在變裝！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.03,0:09:29.12,Text,Sunglass Renji,0,0,0,,我… 我馬上去拿袋子給您！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.12,0:09:30.30,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,啊 等一下！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.78,0:09:33.29,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,真是的！ 那個人到底是怎樣啊！？ 啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.23,0:09:40.23,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,咦！ 不… 不是啦！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.23,0:09:41.18,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,真的嗎？
Dialogue: 1,0:09:40.23,0:09:41.18,Text-English,Lily,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.59,0:09:44.23,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,不是那樣的啦！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.03,0:09:55.05,High,Lily's Mom,0,0,0,,妳要的不是這支嗎？
Dialogue: 1,0:09:53.03,0:09:55.05,High-English,Lily's Mom,0,0,0,,Isn't this the pen you fancied?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.17,0:09:57.83,High,Lily,0,0,0,,不是 我想要更閃亮亮的！
Dialogue: 1,0:09:55.17,0:09:57.83,High-English,Lily,0,0,0,,No! I want one that's more sparkly!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.26,0:10:01.49,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,葵衣有支筆
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.49,0:10:04.75,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,寫完之後換個角度看 顏色就會變成七彩的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.75,0:10:06.34,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,超級可愛的！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.71,0:10:09.83,Text,Lily's Mom,0,0,0,,我們是來買念書用的文具吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.83,0:10:12.07,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,當… 當然
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.07,0:10:13.99,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,我看看喔…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.22,0:10:19.22,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,咦 莉莉
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.48,0:10:23.19,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,咦？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.94,0:10:25.22,Text,Lily's Mom,0,0,0,,怎麼了？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.62,0:10:28.08,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,那個… 晚安
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.08,0:10:30.06,Text,Lily's Mom,0,0,0,,晚… 晚安
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.65,0:10:33.21,High,Lily's Mom,0,0,0,,妳認識那個男生嗎？ 為什麼要躲起來？
Dialogue: 1,0:10:30.65,0:10:33.21,High-English,Lily's Mom,0,0,0,,Do you know that boy? Why'd you hide?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.32,0:10:34.98,High,Lily,0,0,0,,認識是認識 但…
Dialogue: 1,0:10:33.32,0:10:34.98,High-English,Lily,0,0,0,,Yeah, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.23,0:10:39.44,High,Lily,0,0,0,,我今天穿得不好看 不想被他看到
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.66,0:10:41.37,High,Lily's Mom,0,0,0,,快打招呼！
Dialogue: 1,0:10:39.66,0:10:41.37,High-English,Lily's Mom,0,0,0,,Hey! Say hello!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.49,0:10:43.95,High,Lily,0,0,0,,媽… 媽 不要啦！ 不要逼我！
Dialogue: 1,0:10:41.49,0:10:43.95,High-English,Lily,0,0,0,,M-Mum, no! Don't make me!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.19,0:10:44.46,Top,Renji,0,0,0,,這到底是什麼情況？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.95,0:10:49.40,Text,Lily's Mom,0,0,0,,哎呀 原來你是遊樂場的店員啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.40,0:10:51.58,Text,Lily's Mom,0,0,0,,我還以為是她男朋友呢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.80,0:10:54.46,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,咦 您是這樣想的嗎！？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.63,0:10:56.34,Text,Lily's Mom,0,0,0,,呵呵 開玩笑的啦
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.15,0:11:01.08,Text,Lily's Mom,0,0,0,,謝謝你喔 我女兒一直以來都受你照顧了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.08,0:11:02.77,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,我才要謝謝妳們
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.77,0:11:06.10,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,莉莉常常來玩 我們也很開心
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.31,0:11:10.77,Text,Lily's Mom,0,0,0,,那孩子來日本之後 是開始去遊樂場才變得開朗的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.77,0:11:12.72,Text,Lily's Mom,0,0,0,,想必是玩得很開心吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.72,0:11:14.44,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,是這樣嗎…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.44,0:11:15.80,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,總覺得有點害羞
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.80,0:11:19.48,Text,Lily's Mom,0,0,0,,啊 那個無尾熊娃娃也是遊樂場的吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.69,0:11:23.78,Text,Lily's Mom,0,0,0,,那孩子很喜歡抱著那隻娃娃睡覺呢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.78,0:11:26.93,High,Lily,0,0,0,,媽！ 妳幹嘛跟他說這個啦！？
Dialogue: 1,0:11:23.78,0:11:26.93,High-English,Lily,0,0,0,,Mum! Why would you tell him that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.93,0:11:28.61,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,感覺是個很幸福的家庭呢…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.99,0:11:34.13,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,對了 妳剛才在找的原子筆 我好像有印象喔
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.41,0:11:35.46,Text,Lily & Lily's Mom,0,0,0,,- 咦？\N- 咦？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.80,0:11:39.38,High,Lily,0,0,0,,對！ 我想要這個！
Dialogue: 1,0:11:37.80,0:11:39.38,High-English,Lily,0,0,0,,Yes, I wanted this!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.26,0:11:41.88,High,Lily,0,0,0,,媽 我的錢包
Dialogue: 1,0:11:40.26,0:11:41.88,High-English,Lily,0,0,0,,Mum. My wallet.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.03,0:11:43.23,High,Lily's Mom,0,0,0,,冷靜點
Dialogue: 1,0:11:42.03,0:11:43.23,High-English,Lily's Mom,0,0,0,,Calm down!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.23,0:11:46.34,High,Lily's Mom,0,0,0,,妳每次都在遊樂場花光零用錢
Dialogue: 1,0:11:43.23,0:11:46.34,High-English,Lily's Mom,0,0,0,,You always end up spending all your pocket money at arcades!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.56,0:11:47.93,High,Lily,0,0,0,,可是我…
Dialogue: 1,0:11:46.56,0:11:47.93,High-English,Lily,0,0,0,,But I...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.20,0:11:50.30,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,給妳
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.60,0:11:53.41,Text,Lily's Mom,0,0,0,,剛… 剛剛一瞬間就！？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.41,0:11:55.82,Text,Lily's Mom,0,0,0,,你… 難不成是忍者！？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.82,0:11:56.99,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,忍法！？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.99,0:11:59.86,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,不是啦 我只是個普通的遊樂場店員
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.87,0:12:03.36,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,這是感謝妳一直來我們遊樂場玩的回禮
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.36,0:12:05.28,High,Lily,0,0,0,,可以嗎？
Dialogue: 1,0:12:04.36,0:12:05.28,High-English,Lily,0,0,0,,Can I?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.41,0:12:09.75,High,Lily's Mom,0,0,0,,他都這麼堅持了 拒絕的話太失禮了
Dialogue: 1,0:12:05.41,0:12:09.75,High-English,Lily's Mom,0,0,0,,Well, he insisted. So it would be rather rude to turn him down.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.89,0:12:21.14,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,謝謝你 蓮司
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.63,0:12:28.06,Top,Announcement,0,0,0,,非常感謝您今天的蒞臨
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.45,0:12:30.70,Top,Announcement,0,0,0,,本店即將結束營業…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.56,0:12:29.89,High,Lily,0,0,0,,這段旋律…？
Dialogue: 1,0:12:28.56,0:12:29.89,High-English,Lily,0,0,0,,This jingle...?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.85,0:12:34.44,High,Lily,0,0,0,,咦 是《友誼萬歲》嗎？ 怎麼回事？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.85,0:12:34.44,Comment,Lily,0,0,0,,※ 蘇格蘭民謠，詞彙本意為「過去的時光」，另譯《友誼地久天長》
Dialogue: 1,0:12:30.85,0:12:34.44,High-English,Lily,0,0,0,,Hey, is "Auld Lang Syne" playing? What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.48,0:12:38.35,Text,Lily's Mom,0,0,0,,啊啊 那是代表「今天已經要關門了」喔
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.35,0:12:41.40,Text,Lily's Mom,0,0,0,,就是「See you tomorrow」 「明天見」的意思喔
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.14,0:12:44.15,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,為什麼？
Dialogue: 1,0:12:43.14,0:12:44.15,Text-English,Lily,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.15,0:12:46.75,Text,Lily's Mom,0,0,0,,咦 為什麼呢…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.75,0:12:53.08,Text,Lily's Mom,0,0,0,,它原本是英國的民謠 不知道為什麼在日本店家要關門的時候會放呢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.08,0:12:55.37,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,在英國不一樣嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.37,0:13:00.18,Text,Lily's Mom,0,0,0,,對啊 真要說的話 比較像是在慶祝時唱的歌吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.65,0:13:16.67,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,那我走這邊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.67,0:13:17.94,Text,Lily's Mom,0,0,0,,謝謝你喔
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.43,0:13:21.17,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,莉莉 see you tomorrow！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.22,0:13:28.94,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,See you tomorrow… 明天見
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.64,0:13:42.48,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,好難看懂！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.64,0:13:57.49,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,咦？ 那個店員完全不回應妳的攻勢嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.70,0:14:00.35,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,沒錯
Dialogue: 1,0:13:58.70,0:14:00.35,Text-English,Lily,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.58,0:14:03.19,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,謝謝妳今天來遊樂場
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.83,0:14:06.18,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,今天也是開心的一天呢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.65,0:14:08.64,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,希望明天也是晴天
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.41,0:14:15.20,High,Lily,0,0,0,,我們已經遇到瓶頸了嗎？
Dialogue: 1,0:14:12.41,0:14:15.20,High-English,Lily,0,0,0,,Are we going through a rough patch already?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.23,0:14:18.25,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,雖然聽不懂妳在說什麼… 但應該不是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.52,0:14:22.50,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,嗯 那個像小混混的店員啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.80,0:14:25.28,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,不知道他到底是輕浮還是好人
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.28,0:14:30.02,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,老實說 我還沒摸清他是怎樣的人…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.24,0:14:33.49,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,那麼 該怎麼幫她才好呢…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.61,0:14:37.27,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,對了… 遇到這種情況
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.53,0:14:40.26,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,就要「推不動的話就拉拉看」喔！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.53,0:14:40.26,Comment,Aoi,0,0,0,,※ {\fnNoto Sans CJK JP}押してもダメなら引いてみろ{\r}：日文諺語，意指「以退為進」
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.15,0:14:44.20,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,Don't push, pull! 懂嗎！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.20,0:14:45.01,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,哦！
Dialogue: 1,0:14:44.20,0:14:45.01,Text-English,Lily,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.23,0:14:48.58,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,不是叫妳真的去拉啦！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.17,0:14:54.57,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,歡迎光臨
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.26,0:14:57.33,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,莉莉 今天也來了啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.33,0:15:00.07,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,等等 葵衣也跟她一起來嗎！？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.39,0:15:06.84,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,變身！ 男子漢模式！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.11,0:15:10.09,Text,Part-timer A,0,0,0,,你給我好好工作
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.80,0:15:11.59,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,是…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.07,0:15:15.86,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,那個… 請問有什麼需要幫忙的嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.77,0:15:19.59,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,那個…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.86,0:15:21.64,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,咦！？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.28,0:15:35.34,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,咦！？ 又用看可疑人物的眼神看我了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.34,0:15:37.71,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,我有做錯什麼嗎！？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.71,0:15:39.93,Text,Part-timer A,0,0,0,,蓮司君！ 工！ 作！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.93,0:15:40.95,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,好… 好的！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.08,0:15:45.70,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,太棒了 妳演得真好 莉莉！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.70,0:15:49.13,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,平常那麼積極的莉莉突然變得這麼冷淡
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.13,0:15:54.33,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,現在那個店員的腦子裡一定都是莉莉了！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.33,0:15:57.27,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,至少我看的雜誌上是這麼寫的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.27,0:15:58.89,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,不過真的有用嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.60,0:16:03.23,High,Lily,0,0,0,,好難…
Dialogue: 1,0:16:01.60,0:16:03.23,High-English,Lily,0,0,0,,This is hard...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.23,0:16:05.24,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,妳… 妳還好嗎！？ 莉莉！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.11,0:16:11.10,High,Lily,0,0,0,,我冷靜一下… 就會好一點…
Dialogue: 1,0:16:06.11,0:16:11.10,High-English,Lily,0,0,0,,I'll feel better after I... calm down a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.10,0:16:14.74,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,只是稍微冷淡一點就變成這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.08,0:16:18.50,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,莉莉 妳真的很喜歡那個人耶…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.00,0:16:20.74,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,好！ 去偵查！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.06,0:16:23.75,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,莉莉妳都這麼犧牲了！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.75,0:16:26.44,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,肯定效果拔群的啦！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.88,0:16:30.53,Text,Female Customer A,0,0,0,,店員先生 這個完全夾不到
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.53,0:16:32.68,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,啊啊 這台是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.68,0:16:35.77,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,這不是用爪子夾 是用推的喔
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.77,0:16:38.20,Text,Female Customer B,0,0,0,,這樣啊 好好笑
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.20,0:16:40.51,Text,Female Customer A,0,0,0,,那店員先生你示範一下嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.51,0:16:43.13,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,抱歉 這種事情我不能做
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.13,0:16:43.94,Text,Female Customer A,0,0,0,,欸…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.94,0:16:46.23,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,他跟客人應對得很正常嘛！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.23,0:16:47.53,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,而且對方還是女的！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.53,0:16:51.53,Top,Female Customer B,0,0,0,,話說你為什麼穿得這麼奇怪啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.02,0:16:51.61,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,不過仔細想想 這樣好像也蠻正常的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.53,0:16:53.58,Top,Renji,0,0,0,,咦 我也不知道…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.61,0:16:53.02,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,畢竟他現在在工作
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.41,0:17:03.19,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,我不該對這兩人的關係套用普通的戀愛技巧的！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.19,0:17:06.18,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,這顯然是我的戰術失誤！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.29,0:17:08.62,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,那… 那個啊 莉莉 我覺得啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.96,0:17:10.18,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,莉莉？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.18,0:17:12.59,Text,Female Customer A,0,0,0,,話說你為什麼要變裝啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.59,0:17:14.38,Text,Female Customer B,0,0,0,,好好笑喔
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.08,0:17:31.03,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,蓮司你這個笨蛋…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.14,0:17:33.94,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,笨蛋！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.77,0:17:36.25,Text,Female Customer A,0,0,0,,咦？ 什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.25,0:17:37.71,Text,Female Customer B,0,0,0,,妳還好嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.27,0:17:40.79,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,結果還是推下去了！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.14,0:17:42.94,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,物理上！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.05,0:17:55.30,Text,Lily's Mom,0,0,0,,今天的晚餐是 大家最喜歡的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.30,0:17:56.04,Text,Lily's Mom,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.75,0:18:02.65,Text,Lily's Mom,0,0,0,,咦？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.34,0:18:06.85,Text,Lily's Mom,0,0,0,,「推不動的話就拉拉看」？
Comment: 0,0:18:04.34,0:18:06.85,Comment,Comment,0,0,0,,（這裡的原文是「押してダメなら引いてみろ」，も消失了，估計也是製作方的鍋--椎名真晝不只可愛而已）
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.85,0:18:07.56,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,嗯…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.57,0:18:13.39,Text,Lily's Mom,0,0,0,,唉… 結果不順利 最後就把他推倒了是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.39,0:18:14.07,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,嗯…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.39,0:18:19.37,Text,Lily's Mom,0,0,0,,真是的… 對那個店員來說 真是飛來橫禍呢
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.90,0:18:22.63,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,我知道是我不對
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.63,0:18:23.32,Text,Lily's Mom,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.54,0:18:28.00,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,可是… 看到蓮司跟其他女生說話…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.65,0:18:31.77,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,就覺得胸口好悶
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.22,0:18:34.72,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,身體就不自覺地動了起來
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.62,0:18:36.96,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,媽媽
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.31,0:18:38.46,Text,Lily's Mom,0,0,0,,呼
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.46,0:18:41.88,Text,Lily's Mom,0,0,0,,我差點被自己女兒的可愛給萌死
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.40,0:18:46.23,Text,Lily's Mom,0,0,0,,如果妳是這麼想的 那就沒問題！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.23,0:18:48.73,Text,Lily's Mom,0,0,0,,只要好好道歉 事情就會解決的！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.53,0:18:51.24,Text,Lily's Mom,0,0,0,,然後啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.58,0:18:55.98,Text,Lily's Mom,0,0,0,,我再把我的「抓住男人心的必殺技」傳授給妳！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.98,0:18:57.02,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,咦！？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.02,0:19:00.24,Text,Lily's Mom,0,0,0,,媽媽我啊 就是靠這招把爸爸追到手的喔
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.24,0:19:01.43,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,真的！？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.89,0:19:04.22,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,我先走了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.22,0:19:05.77,Text,Part-timer A,0,0,0,,辛苦啦
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.13,0:19:10.15,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,結果 那之後莉莉就沒來了啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.89,0:19:14.89,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,被她瞪了 還被她推開
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.89,0:19:17.18,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,我是真的被她討厭了嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.35,0:19:20.89,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,蓮司！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.39,0:19:28.42,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,我有… 話想跟你說
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.21,0:19:35.48,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,好吃！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.52,0:19:38.23,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,真的很好吃喔！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.44,0:19:40.53,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,這個真的是妳自己做的嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.70,0:19:43.37,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,嗯… 也不是只有我…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.76,0:19:51.53,Flashback,Aoi,0,0,0,,咦？ 奇怪？ 我明明照著食譜做的啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.79,0:19:55.16,Flashback,Aoi,0,0,0,,算… 算了 雖然賣相不好但味道應該還…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.42,0:19:58.42,Flashback,Aoi,0,0,0,,哇！ 對不起 讓妳露出那種表情
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.14,0:20:01.31,Flashback,Lily,0,0,0,,謝謝妳幫我
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.14,0:20:01.31,Flashback-English,Lily,0,0,0,,Thanks for helping me out.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:01.31,0:20:02.91,Flashback,Aoi,0,0,0,,沒事 沒事啦
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.91,0:20:05.43,Flashback,Aoi,0,0,0,,這次的事我也有錯
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.43,0:20:09.44,Flashback,Aoi,0,0,0,,而且… 朋友的戀情我一定要支持到底！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.77,0:20:11.40,Flashback,Lily,0,0,0,,朋友…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.90,0:20:13.94,Flashback,Lily,0,0,0,,謝謝妳 葵衣！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.94,0:20:16.66,Flashback,Aoi,0,0,0,,好！ 莉莉媽媽直傳
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.66,0:20:19.78,Flashback,Aoi,0,0,0,,「想抓住男人的心 就要先抓住他的胃」作戰
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.78,0:20:21.30,Flashback,Aoi,0,0,0,,一定要成功喔！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.30,0:20:22.69,Flashback,Lily,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.30,0:20:22.69,Flashback-English,Lily,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.02,0:20:24.49,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,是葵衣啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.49,0:20:27.60,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,那傢伙還真是愛多管閒事
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.40,0:20:31.79,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,筆記… 請看
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.79,0:20:33.59,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,咦？ 現在嗎…？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.67,0:20:43.84,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,給蓮司
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.37,0:20:48.87,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,之前突然瞪了你 還推了你 對不起
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.87,0:20:54.35,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,那是我試著照葵衣教我的「推不動的話就拉拉看」去做的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.62,0:20:56.44,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,但好像不太順利…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.44,0:20:57.56,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,原來是這樣…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.86,0:21:00.35,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,原來這也是那傢伙多管閒事引起的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.89,0:21:01.97,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,可是…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.81,0:21:07.54,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,蓮司不理我 還有跟其他女生說話
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.54,0:21:09.60,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,讓我覺得很難過 這也是真的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.02,0:21:10.91,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,咦
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.17,0:21:16.38,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,我… 該怎麼辦才好？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.38,0:21:20.40,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,咦！？ 呃… 那個…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.40,0:21:22.12,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,這… 這個嘛…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.84,0:21:27.47,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,如果我不是在遊樂場打工的話 就可以花更多時間陪妳了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.47,0:21:28.64,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,什麼！？
Dialogue: 1,0:21:27.47,0:21:28.64,Text-English,Lily,0,0,0,,What!?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.92,0:21:30.14,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,這個嘛…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.85,0:21:33.60,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,沒有「打工」… 我們就… 可以「享受」
Dialogue: 1,0:21:30.85,0:21:33.60,Text-English,Renji,0,0,0,,No baito, we can enjoy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.89,0:21:35.02,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,開玩笑的啦… 哈哈
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.56,0:21:39.75,High,Lily,0,0,0,,你願意在遊樂場外跟我見面嗎？
Dialogue: 1,0:21:36.56,0:21:39.75,High-English,Lily,0,0,0,,You would meet me outside the arcade?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.75,0:21:42.29,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,咦…？ 呃… 嗯…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.28,0:21:49.28,High,Lily,0,0,0,,你的意思是… 像約會那樣嗎！？
Dialogue: 1,0:21:46.28,0:21:49.28,High-English,Lily,0,0,0,,You mean... like on a date?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.11,0:21:51.31,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,約會…？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.29,0:21:54.91,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,約會！？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.91,0:21:57.66,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,事情演變成這樣了嗎！？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.02,0:22:00.21,Text,Narrator (Otogoki Koala),0,0,0,,於是 莉莉與蓮司…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.71,0:22:03.02,Text,Narrator (Otogoki Koala),0,0,0,,他們的第一次約會就這麼決定了！
